{
  "description": "Inferences: reasoning written into the case. Each rests on premises (clues and background facts) and has a formula. The player builds an inference by connecting its premises, or hears a character state it (`stated`: who, and the quote where), or (Trivial) is given it once its premises are known; a held inference counts like a trusted clue until doubted. `truth: false` marks a character's wrong reasoning: the case reads it doubted, so its truth comes out false. Holmes's are also stated where the story tells the route step that needs them (worked out, not listed here).",
  "constraints": [
    {"id": "k.drugger_knew_the_menu", "label": "Opium can be tasted and a curry hides it; bringing opium on the one night a curry is served is too great a coincidence: the drugger knew what the house would have for supper.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.curry_for_supper", "c.household_same_dish", "c.opium_in_remains", "c.opium_in_portion_only", "r.opium_taste", "r.curry_masks", "r.no_coincidence"], "formula": {"eq": [{"rel": ["knew_menu", "straker_villa", "e.opium_added.agent"]}, "true"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.opium_taste", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added"}}, {"rule": "r.curry_masks", "bind": {"dish": "curried_mutton"}}, {"rule": "r.no_coincidence", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added", "portion": "hunter_portion", "dish": "curried_mutton", "choosing": "e.curry_chosen", "house": "straker_villa"}}]},
    {"id": "k.drugger_knew_the_dish", "label": "The drugger knew what the house would have for supper, and only the people of its own establishment knew that: the drugger was one of the King's Pyland people, not a stranger who came along with his paper ready.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["k.drugger_knew_the_menu", "c.straker_household", "c.bribe_to_edith", "r.menu_known_at_home"], "formula": {"eq": [{"rel": ["of_establishment", "e.opium_added.agent"]}, "kings_pyland"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.menu_known_at_home", "bind": {"house": "straker_villa"}}]},
    {"id": "k.drugger_chose_the_dish", "label": "A drug that had to be hidden, brought on the one night a dish that hides it was served: the drugger arranged the dish, and only the master and mistress choose supper. So the drugger is Straker or his wife.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.curry_for_supper", "c.opium_in_remains", "c.opium_in_portion_only", "c.household_same_dish", "c.straker_household", "r.opium_taste", "r.curry_masks", "r.planned_the_dish"], "formula": {"in": ["e.opium_added.agent", ["straker", "mrs_straker"]]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.opium_taste", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added"}}, {"rule": "r.curry_masks", "bind": {"dish": "curried_mutton"}}, {"rule": "r.planned_the_dish", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added", "portion": "hunter_portion", "dish": "curried_mutton", "choosing": "e.curry_chosen", "house": "straker_villa"}}]},
    {"id": "k.menu_choosers", "label": "Who chose the supper: the master or the mistress.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.household_same_dish", "c.straker_household", "r.menu_chosen_by_household"], "formula": {"in": ["e.curry_chosen.agent", ["straker", "mrs_straker"]]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.menu_chosen_by_household", "bind": {"choosing": "e.curry_chosen", "house": "straker_villa"}}]},
    {"id": "k.drugged_after_set_aside", "label": "The others ate the same dish unharmed, so the opium went into Hunter's portion after it was taken from the dish.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.household_same_dish", "c.opium_in_portion_only", "c.curry_for_supper", "k.portion_dished_at_supper", "r.same_dish_safe"], "formula": {"not_after": ["e.portion_set_aside.time", "e.opium_added.time"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.same_dish_safe", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added", "portion": "hunter_portion", "dish": "curried_mutton", "setting": "e.portion_set_aside", "meal": "e.household_sups"}}]},
    {"id": "k.portion_dished_at_supper", "label": "Hunter's portion was taken from the household's dish where and when they supped: at the house, at nine.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.curry_for_supper", "c.household_same_dish", "r.set_aside_at_the_meal"], "formula": {"and": [{"eq": ["e.portion_set_aside.place", "straker_villa"]}, {"eq": ["e.portion_set_aside.time", "w.mon_2100"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.set_aside_at_the_meal", "bind": {"setting": "e.portion_set_aside", "meal": "e.household_sups", "portion": "hunter_portion", "dish": "curried_mutton"}}]},
    {"id": "k.drugged_in_food", "label": "The lad on duty drank only from the stable tap: if he was drugged, it was in the food brought to him, not in his water.", "by": "editorial", "premises": ["c.no_liquid", "r.tap_water_not_dosed"], "formula": {"ne": ["e.opium_added.object", "water_tap"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.tap_water_not_dosed", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added", "tap": "water_tap"}}]},
    {"id": "k.not_a_robbery", "label": "His money and his watch were still on him: whoever struck him down did not do it to rob him.", "by": "editorial", "premises": ["c.pocket_inventory", "c.head_shattered", "r.stays_held", "r.robber_takes_valuables"], "formula": {"ne": ["e.fatal_blow.purpose", "rob"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.stays_held", "bind": {"thing": "sovereigns", "from": "w.tue_after", "to": "w.tue_morning"}}, {"rule": "r.robber_takes_valuables", "bind": {"blow": "e.fatal_blow", "victim": "straker", "item": "sovereigns", "after": "w.tue_after"}}]},
    {"id": "k.knife_bared", "label": "The cork guard lay beside the body: the knife's blade was bare in the hollow.", "by": "editorial", "premises": ["c.cork_by_body", "r.guard_off_bares"], "formula": {"eq": ["st.cataract_knife.sheathed.tue_morning", "false"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.guard_off_bares", "bind": {"removal": "e.cork_removed", "guard": "cork_disk", "blade": "cataract_knife", "when": "w.tue_morning"}}]},
    {"id": "k.stranger_came_on_purpose", "label": "He knew that a stable-boy sleeps there alone every night, which no stranger lost on the moor would know: he had not lost his way, he came on purpose.", "by": "editorial", "premises": ["c.stranger_knew_lad_alone", "r.lost_does_not_know"], "formula": {"ne": ["st.the_stranger.aims.mon_2105", "find_way"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.lost_does_not_know", "bind": {"who": "the_stranger", "when": "w.mon_2105"}}]},
    {"id": "k.brown_keeps_horse_safe", "label": "Brown knows that his only hope of mercy is to produce the horse safe: he will keep it safe until the race.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.brown_hope_of_mercy", "r.mercy_keeps_safe"], "formula": {"eq": ["st.silas_brown.aims.thu_night", "keep_safe"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.mercy_keeps_safe", "bind": {"who": "silas_brown", "when": "w.thu_night"}}]},
    {"id": "k.portion_set_aside_before_edith", "label": "The portion was set aside at the house at supper, at nine, before Edith carried it down a few minutes later.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.edith_carried_supper", "c.household_same_dish", "c.curry_for_supper", "c.lads_supped_at_house", "r.set_aside_at_the_meal"], "formula": {"and": [{"before": ["e.portion_set_aside.time", "e.edith_carries_supper.time"]}, {"not_after": ["e.lads_to_supper.time", "e.portion_set_aside.time"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.set_aside_at_the_meal", "bind": {"setting": "e.portion_set_aside", "meal": "e.household_sups", "portion": "hunter_portion", "dish": "curried_mutton"}}]},
    {"id": "k.straker_home_all_evening", "label": "Straker heard of the tout only by message after the lads came back: he was at the house all evening, never at the stable or on the path.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.lads_returned_message", "c.straker_uneasy"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.opium_added.agent", "straker"]}, {"eq": ["e.opium_added.place", "straker_villa"]}]}, "asserted": "The story never places Straker between nine and the message that reached him at the house later in the evening; that he was at home all evening is the editorial reading of it."},
    {"id": "k.drugged_in_house_means_before_nine_five", "label": "If the opium went in at the house, it went in before Edith carried the dish out.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.edith_carried_supper", "c.household_same_dish", "c.curry_for_supper", "c.lads_supped_at_house", "c.opium_in_portion_only", "r.set_aside_at_the_meal", "r.dosed_before_carried_off"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.opium_added.place", "straker_villa"]}, {"before": ["e.opium_added.time", "e.edith_carries_supper.time"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.set_aside_at_the_meal", "bind": {"setting": "e.portion_set_aside", "meal": "e.household_sups", "portion": "hunter_portion", "dish": "curried_mutton"}}, {"rule": "r.dosed_before_carried_off", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added", "keeping": "e.portion_set_aside", "carrying": "e.edith_carries_supper"}}]},
    {"id": "k.window_drugging_time", "label": "If the opium went in at the stable window, it was while the stranger stood there.", "by": "gregory", "premises": ["c.stranger_asked_for_tip", "c.stranger_leaning_in"], "formula": {"implies": [{"in": ["e.opium_added.place", ["stable_window", "stable"]]}, {"eq": ["e.opium_added.time", "w.mon_2110"]}]}, "asserted": "Gregory's conditional: its only support is that the stranger stood at the window at ten past nine; nothing says the dish could not have been reached there later."},
    {"id": "k.drugger_took_the_horse", "label": "The guard was drugged so that the horse could be taken: the drugger and the one who took the horse are the same person, and the horse went after the lad had eaten — after he was last seen about his duties, sending word of the tout.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.hunter_ate_drugged", "c.stall_empty", "c.hunter_on_guard", "c.lads_returned_message", "c.opium_in_portion_only", "r.drugged_guard"], "formula": {"and": [{"same": ["e.opium_added.agent", "e.horse_led_out.agent"]}, {"before": ["e.hunter_eats.time", "e.horse_led_out.time"]}, {"before": ["e.message_to_straker.time", "e.horse_led_out.time"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.drugged_guard", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added", "eating": "e.hunter_eats", "guard": "e.hunter_on_guard", "duty": "e.message_to_straker", "taking": "e.horse_led_out"}}]},
    {"id": "k.visitor_is_taker", "label": "Whoever came into the stable in the night is the one who took out the horse.", "by": "holmes", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.stall_empty", "c.stable_door_open", "r.taker_entered"], "formula": {"and": [{"same": ["midnight_visitor.identity", "e.horse_led_out.agent"]}, {"same": ["e.stable_entered.agent", "e.horse_led_out.agent"]}, {"same": ["e.stable_entered.time", "e.horse_led_out.time"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.taker_entered", "bind": {"visitor": "midnight_visitor", "entering": "e.stable_entered", "taking": "e.horse_led_out"}}]},
    {"id": "k.later_entry_needs_key", "label": "The boy locked the door and the window is too small for a man: whoever came in by the door afterwards came in with a key.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.door_locked_behind", "c.window_too_small", "r.locked_door_needs_key"], "formula": {"implies": [{"and": [{"eq": ["e.stable_entered.object", "stable_door"]}, {"before": ["e.hunter_locks_door.time", "e.stable_entered.time"]}]}, {"in": ["e.stable_entered.instrument", ["stable_key", "duplicate_key"]]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.locked_door_needs_key", "bind": {"locking": "e.hunter_locks_door", "opening": "e.stable_entered"}}]},
    {"id": "k.door_opened_with_key", "label": "The door locked at ten past nine was found open at seven: it was opened in between, and so with a key.", "by": "editorial", "premises": ["k.later_entry_needs_key", "c.door_locked_behind", "c.stable_door_open", "r.opened_between"], "formula": {"in": ["e.stable_entered.instrument", ["stable_key", "duplicate_key"]]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.opened_between", "bind": {"locking": "e.hunter_locks_door", "opening": "e.stable_entered", "finding": "e.stable_found_open"}}]},
    {"id": "k.entrant_took_the_horse", "label": "Whoever came into the stable that night took the horse out, then and there.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.stall_empty", "c.stable_door_open", "r.taker_entered"], "formula": {"and": [{"same": ["e.stable_entered.agent", "e.horse_led_out.agent"]}, {"same": ["e.stable_entered.time", "e.horse_led_out.time"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.taker_entered", "bind": {"visitor": "midnight_visitor", "entering": "e.stable_entered", "taking": "e.horse_led_out"}}]},
    {"id": "k.taker_had_a_key", "label": "The horse was led out of the locked stable and on to the hollow by someone who came in with a key.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["k.door_opened_with_key", "k.entrant_took_the_horse", "k.led_by_taker", "c.horse_was_in_hollow"], "formula": {"and": [{"in": ["e.stable_entered.instrument", ["stable_key", "duplicate_key"]]}, {"same": ["e.led_to_hollow.agent", "e.stable_entered.agent"]}]}},
    {"id": "k.bridled_by_taker", "label": "A horse does not bridle itself: whoever led it out bridled it.", "by": "police", "premises": ["c.bridle_missing", "c.stall_empty", "r.bridle_needs_a_hand"], "formula": {"and": [{"same": ["e.horse_bridled.agent", "e.horse_led_out.agent"]}, {"same": ["e.horse_bridled.time", "e.horse_led_out.time"]}]}, "stated": [{"by": "police", "source": ["His bridle is missing, so that Simpson must have put this on"]}], "rules": [{"rule": "r.bridle_needs_a_hand", "bind": {"bridling": "e.horse_bridled", "taking": "e.horse_led_out"}}]},
    {"id": "k.dog_knew_the_visitor", "label": "A dog was in the stable; someone came in while it was there; the dog did not bark enough to wake the lads. A dog barks at strangers — so whoever came in was someone it knew well: someone of King's Pyland.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.dog_kept_in_stable", "c.dog_did_nothing", "c.stall_empty", "c.stable_door_open", "r.dog_knows_its_own", "r.dog_barks_at_strangers"], "formula": {"eq": [{"rel": ["of_establishment", "e.stable_entered.agent"]}, "kings_pyland"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.dog_barks_at_strangers", "bind": {"dog": "stable_dog", "visit": "e.stable_entered", "silence": "e.dog_silent"}}, {"rule": "r.dog_knows_its_own", "bind": {"dog": "stable_dog"}}]},
    {"id": "k.hunter_was_drugged", "label": "Hunter was in a drugged stupor from his supper until he came round on Tuesday; the horse went in between: he took nothing out, and so did not drug himself either.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.hunter_ate_drugged", "c.hunter_stupor", "c.hunter_knows_cravat", "c.stall_empty", "c.hunter_on_guard", "c.lads_returned_message", "c.opium_in_portion_only", "c.stable_door_open", "r.drugged_guard", "r.gone_before_found", "r.stupor_is_helpless"], "formula": {"and": [{"ne": ["e.horse_led_out.agent", "ned_hunter"]}, {"ne": ["e.opium_added.agent", "ned_hunter"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.drugged_guard", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added", "eating": "e.hunter_eats", "guard": "e.hunter_on_guard", "duty": "e.message_to_straker", "taking": "e.horse_led_out"}}, {"rule": "r.gone_before_found", "bind": {"taking": "e.horse_led_out", "finding": "e.stable_found_open"}}, {"rule": "r.stupor_is_helpless", "bind": {"man": "ned_hunter", "eating": "e.hunter_eats", "recovery": "e.hunter_recovers", "doing": "e.horse_led_out"}}]},
    {"id": "k.wife_stayed_home", "label": "Mrs. Straker was at home all night: in bed at one, when her husband went out, she woke there at seven.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.straker_dressing_at_one", "c.wife_woke_at_seven", "r.stays_put"], "formula": {"and": [{"eq": ["st.mrs_straker.at.tue_stable", "straker_villa"]}, {"eq": ["st.mrs_straker.at.tue_hollow", "straker_villa"]}, {"eq": ["st.mrs_straker.at.tue_blow", "straker_villa"]}, {"eq": ["st.mrs_straker.at.tue_after", "straker_villa"]}, {"eq": ["st.mrs_straker.at.tue_dawn", "straker_villa"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.stays_put", "bind": {"thing": "mrs_straker", "from": "w.tue_0100", "to": "w.tue_stable"}}, {"rule": "r.stays_put", "bind": {"thing": "mrs_straker", "from": "w.tue_0100", "to": "w.tue_hollow"}}, {"rule": "r.stays_put", "bind": {"thing": "mrs_straker", "from": "w.tue_0100", "to": "w.tue_blow"}}, {"rule": "r.stays_put", "bind": {"thing": "mrs_straker", "from": "w.tue_0100", "to": "w.tue_after"}}, {"rule": "r.stays_put", "bind": {"thing": "mrs_straker", "from": "w.tue_0100", "to": "w.tue_dawn"}}]},
    {"id": "k.night_sequence", "label": "The horse was taken from the stable, then was in the hollow at the struggle, and left it afterwards along the track; Straker, who left home at one, died there of the blow that shattered his head, and the cut on his thigh came at the same time.", "by": "holmes", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.stall_empty", "c.horse_was_in_hollow", "c.body_in_hollow", "c.straker_left_in_mackintosh", "c.horse_track_in_wet_hollow", "c.horse_alone", "c.head_shattered", "c.thigh_cut", "r.leaves_before_arriving", "r.blow_is_the_death"], "formula": {"and": [{"before": ["e.horse_led_out.time", "e.led_to_hollow.time"]}, {"not_after": ["e.led_to_hollow.time", "e.fatal_blow.time"]}, {"before": ["e.fatal_blow.time", "e.horse_bolts.time"]}, {"before": ["e.straker_leaves.time", "e.fatal_blow.time"]}, {"same": ["e.straker_dies.time", "e.fatal_blow.time"]}, {"same": ["e.thigh_cut.time", "e.fatal_blow.time"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.leaves_before_arriving", "bind": {"taking": "e.horse_led_out", "arrival": "e.led_to_hollow"}}, {"rule": "r.blow_is_the_death", "bind": {"blow": "e.fatal_blow", "death": "e.straker_dies"}}]},
    {"id": "k.found_before_seven", "label": "The horse was taken out in the night: after Hunter, on guard, sent word of the tout, and before the stable was found open at seven.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.hunter_ate_drugged", "c.stall_empty", "c.hunter_on_guard", "c.lads_returned_message", "c.opium_in_portion_only", "c.stable_door_open", "r.drugged_guard", "r.gone_before_found"], "formula": {"and": [{"before": ["e.horse_led_out.time", "e.stable_found_open.time"]}, {"not_after": [{"lit": "w.tue_0100"}, "e.horse_led_out.time"]}, {"before": ["e.horse_led_out.time", {"lit": "w.tue_0700"}]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.drugged_guard", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added", "eating": "e.hunter_eats", "guard": "e.hunter_on_guard", "duty": "e.message_to_straker", "taking": "e.horse_led_out"}}, {"rule": "r.gone_before_found", "bind": {"taking": "e.horse_led_out", "finding": "e.stable_found_open"}}]},
    {"id": "k.met_after_bolting", "label": "The man near Mapleton met the horse after it had left the hollow.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.horse_alone"], "formula": {"before": ["e.horse_bolts.time", "e.brown_finds_horse.time"]}},
    {"id": "k.coat_placed", "label": "There was no wind, so the coat was not blown onto the bush: it was put there by the man who wore it out, after he left the house.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.coat_on_bush_seen", "c.no_wind", "c.straker_left_in_mackintosh", "r.wind_and_coats"], "formula": {"and": [{"eq": ["e.coat_off.agent", "straker"]}, {"eq": ["e.coat_off.object", "overcoat"]}, {"before": ["e.straker_leaves.time", "e.coat_off.time"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.wind_and_coats", "bind": {"coat": "overcoat", "placing": "e.coat_off", "wearing": "e.straker_leaves"}}]},
    {"id": "k.coat_off_to_work", "label": "Straker laid his own coat across the bush before the blow that killed him: not in a fight, and not to stand in the rain, but to have his arms free for some work.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["k.coat_placed", "c.coat_laid_across", "c.head_shattered", "r.dead_men_do_nothing", "r.coat_off_to_work"], "formula": {"and": [{"before": ["e.coat_off.time", "e.fatal_blow.time"]}, {"eq": ["e.coat_off.purpose", "work"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.dead_men_do_nothing", "bind": {"death": "e.fatal_blow", "doing": "e.coat_off"}}, {"rule": "r.coat_off_to_work", "bind": {"placing": "e.coat_off", "death": "e.fatal_blow"}}]},
    {"id": "k.vesta_from_strakers_box", "label": "A wax vesta was struck in the hollow where Straker lay, and he carried a box of vestas: the match was his, and he struck it before the blow.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.vesta_in_mud", "c.pocket_inventory", "c.head_shattered", "r.vesta_from_box", "r.dead_men_do_nothing"], "formula": {"and": [{"eq": ["wax_vesta.owner", "straker"]}, {"same": ["e.light_struck.agent", "wax_vesta.owner"]}, {"before": ["e.light_struck.time", "e.fatal_blow.time"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.vesta_from_box", "bind": {"match": "wax_vesta", "box": "vesta_box", "striking": "e.light_struck", "death": "e.fatal_blow"}}, {"rule": "r.dead_men_do_nothing", "bind": {"death": "e.fatal_blow", "doing": "e.light_struck"}}]},
    {"id": "k.hollow_order", "label": "The coat came off and the light was struck in the hollow: if the man who did those things was the one who brought the horse there, he did them no earlier than he came.", "by": "holmes", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.horse_was_in_hollow", "c.coat_on_bush_seen", "c.vesta_in_mud", "r.acts_after_arriving"], "formula": {"and": [{"implies": [{"same": ["e.led_to_hollow.agent", "e.coat_off.agent"]}, {"not_after": ["e.led_to_hollow.time", "e.coat_off.time"]}]}, {"implies": [{"same": ["e.led_to_hollow.agent", "e.light_struck.agent"]}, {"not_after": ["e.led_to_hollow.time", "e.light_struck.time"]}]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.acts_after_arriving", "bind": {"arrival": "e.led_to_hollow", "doing": "e.coat_off"}}, {"rule": "r.acts_after_arriving", "bind": {"arrival": "e.led_to_hollow", "doing": "e.light_struck"}}], "stated": [{"by": "holmes", "source": ["Once in the hollow, he had got behind the horse"]}]},
    {"id": "k.led_by_taker", "label": "Whoever took the horse out led it to the hollow.", "by": "police", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.stall_empty", "c.horse_was_in_hollow", "r.taker_leads_on"], "formula": {"same": ["e.led_to_hollow.agent", "e.horse_led_out.agent"]}, "stated": [{"by": "police", "source": ["he was leading the horse away over the moor"]}], "rules": [{"rule": "r.taker_leads_on", "bind": {"taking": "e.horse_led_out", "leading": "e.led_to_hollow"}}]},
    {"id": "k.knife_not_a_weapon", "label": "No one arming himself chooses a cataract knife: Straker, who had it with him, took it for some delicate work.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.knife_is_cataract_knife", "c.knife_delicate", "c.knife_in_right_hand", "r.cataract_knife_use"], "formula": {"and": [{"eq": ["e.knife_taken.agent", "straker"]}, {"eq": ["e.knife_taken.purpose", "operation"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.cataract_knife_use", "bind": {"knife": "cataract_knife", "taking": "e.knife_taken"}}]},
    {"id": "k.knife_for_an_operation", "label": "Straker took a blade for delicate work: if it was he who took the horse out, it was to operate on it, to injure it, and away from the stable where the sleepers would hear.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["k.knife_not_a_weapon", "k.operation_in_the_open", "r.operation_on_the_horse"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.horse_led_out.agent", "straker"]}, {"and": [{"eq": ["e.horse_led_out.purpose", "injure"]}, {"ne": ["e.led_to_hollow.place", "stable"]}]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.operation_on_the_horse", "bind": {"taking": "e.knife_taken", "outing": "e.horse_led_out"}}]},
    {"id": "k.drugging_is_dishonest", "label": "Nobody drugs his own stable-boy for an honest purpose: if Straker drugged him, Straker was dishonest, and took the horse out for no honest reason.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.opium_in_remains", "c.hunter_ate_drugged", "c.stall_empty", "c.hunter_on_guard", "c.lads_returned_message", "c.opium_in_portion_only", "r.honest_men_dont_drug", "r.drugged_guard"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.opium_added.agent", "straker"]}, {"and": [{"eq": ["straker.honest", "false"]}, {"nin": ["e.horse_led_out.purpose", ["exercise"]]}]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.honest_men_dont_drug", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added", "man": "straker", "outing": "e.horse_led_out"}}, {"rule": "r.drugged_guard", "bind": {"dosing": "e.opium_added", "eating": "e.hunter_eats", "guard": "e.hunter_on_guard", "duty": "e.message_to_straker", "taking": "e.horse_led_out"}}]},
    {"id": "k.operation_in_the_open", "label": "If the horse was taken out to be hurt, that was done away from the stable, where a hurt horse would not wake the sleepers and a light would not show.", "by": "holmes", "implicit": true, "premises": ["r.horse_would_wake_sleepers", "r.light_hidden_in_hollow", "c.pocket_inventory", "c.hunter_on_guard", "c.stall_empty"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.horse_led_out.purpose", "injure"]}, {"ne": ["e.led_to_hollow.place", "stable"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.horse_would_wake_sleepers", "bind": {"outing": "e.horse_led_out", "leading": "e.led_to_hollow", "sleepers": "e.hunter_on_guard"}}], "asserted": "An explanation of why the horse had to be taken out at all, not a derivation: the rule needs the hollow event tied to the horse, which only the marks in the hollow give, and those already give the place. Cause and explanation are redesign step 3."},
    {"id": "k.horse_kicked", "label": "A light was struck beside the horse in the hollow; a horse startled by a sudden glare lashes out. The head was shattered by a heavy blow, and the horse was there: the steel shoe killed him.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.head_shattered", "c.horse_was_in_hollow", "c.vesta_in_mud", "r.startled_horse_kicks", "r.hoof_strikes_as_horse_kicks"], "formula": {"and": [{"eq": ["e.fatal_blow.agent", "silver_blaze"]}, {"eq": ["e.fatal_blow.instrument", "steel_shoe"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.startled_horse_kicks", "bind": {"horse": "silver_blaze", "arrival": "e.led_to_hollow", "striking": "e.light_struck", "blow": "e.fatal_blow"}}, {"rule": "r.hoof_strikes_as_horse_kicks", "bind": {"shoe": "steel_shoe", "horse": "silver_blaze", "blow": "e.fatal_blow"}}]},
    {"id": "k.blow_needs_a_wielder", "label": "A heavy stick needs a hand to swing it; a horse's shoe strikes only as the horse kicks.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.head_shattered", "r.hoof_strikes_as_horse_kicks", "r.stick_needs_a_hand"], "formula": {"and": [{"implies": [{"eq": ["e.fatal_blow.instrument", "steel_shoe"]}, {"eq": ["e.fatal_blow.agent", "silver_blaze"]}]}, {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.fatal_blow.agent", "silver_blaze"]}, {"eq": ["e.fatal_blow.instrument", "steel_shoe"]}]}, {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.fatal_blow.instrument", "penang_lawyer"]}, {"same": ["e.fatal_blow.agent", "penang_lawyer.owner"]}]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.hoof_strikes_as_horse_kicks", "bind": {"shoe": "steel_shoe", "horse": "silver_blaze", "blow": "e.fatal_blow"}}, {"rule": "r.stick_needs_a_hand", "bind": {"stick": "penang_lawyer", "blow": "e.fatal_blow"}}]},
    {"id": "k.only_one_blade", "label": "Straker was struck down with his own knife in his hand, and the man accused bears no wound from it: the cut on his thigh was his own knife, as he fell.", "by": "watson", "premises": ["k.knife_marks_assailant", "c.knife_in_right_hand", "c.thigh_cut", "c.head_shattered", "r.convulsions_after_brain_injury"], "formula": {"and": [{"eq": ["e.thigh_cut.instrument", "cataract_knife"]}, {"eq": ["e.thigh_cut.agent", "straker"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.convulsions_after_brain_injury", "bind": {"blow": "e.fatal_blow", "cut": "e.thigh_cut", "held": "cataract_knife"}}]},
    {"id": "k.knife_marks_assailant", "label": "If Straker's knife had cut an assailant, that man would bear a wound; Simpson has none.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.knife_in_right_hand", "c.simpson_no_wound", "c.thigh_cut", "c.head_shattered", "r.knife_marks_assailant", "r.wounds_in_a_struggle"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.fatal_blow.agent", "simpson"]}, {"eq": ["e.thigh_cut.agent", "straker"]}]}, "stated": [{"by": "police", "source": ["one at least of his assailants must bear his mark upon him"]}], "rules": [{"rule": "r.knife_marks_assailant", "bind": {"blow": "e.fatal_blow", "cut": "e.thigh_cut", "man": "simpson"}}, {"rule": "r.wounds_in_a_struggle", "bind": {"blow": "e.fatal_blow", "cut": "e.thigh_cut"}}]},
    {"id": "k.cravat_order", "label": "The cravat was not Straker's: its owner parted with it before it came to Straker's hand, which was after he left home and before he died.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.cravat_in_left_hand", "c.simpson_owns_cravat", "c.straker_left_in_mackintosh", "c.head_shattered", "r.dropped_before_found", "r.not_his_so_found_out", "r.dead_men_do_nothing"], "formula": {"and": [{"same": ["e.cravat_dropped.agent", "cravat.owner"]}, {"not_after": ["e.cravat_dropped.time", "e.cravat_picked_up.time"]}, {"before": ["e.cravat_picked_up.time", "e.fatal_blow.time"]}, {"not_after": ["e.straker_leaves.time", "e.cravat_picked_up.time"]}, {"eq": ["e.cravat_dropped.object", "cravat"]}, {"eq": ["e.cravat_picked_up.object", "cravat"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.dropped_before_found", "bind": {"pick": "e.cravat_picked_up", "drop": "e.cravat_dropped", "thing": "cravat"}}, {"rule": "r.not_his_so_found_out", "bind": {"man": "straker", "leaving": "e.straker_leaves", "pick": "e.cravat_picked_up", "thing": "cravat"}}, {"rule": "r.dead_men_do_nothing", "bind": {"death": "e.fatal_blow", "doing": "e.cravat_picked_up"}}]},
    {"id": "k.cravat_worn_at_window", "label": "The stranger was wearing the cravat when the maid saw him at the stable, so he lost it no earlier than that.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.edith_knows_cravat", "c.stranger_leaning_in", "c.cravat_in_left_hand", "r.worn_then_lost_later", "r.dropped_before_found"], "formula": {"not_after": [{"lit": "w.mon_2110"}, "e.cravat_dropped.time"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.dropped_before_found", "bind": {"pick": "e.cravat_picked_up", "drop": "e.cravat_dropped", "thing": "cravat"}}, {"rule": "r.worn_then_lost_later", "bind": {"wearing": "e.stranger_leans_in", "drop": "e.cravat_dropped"}}]},
    {"id": "k.simpson_purpose", "label": "Simpson came either for information, or to drug the guard, or to steal the horse; each of the last two would make him the drugger or the thief.", "by": "police", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.simpson_admits_visit"], "formula": {"and": [{"implies": [{"eq": ["simpson.purpose", "nobble_horse"]}, {"eq": ["e.opium_added.agent", "simpson"]}]}, {"implies": [{"eq": ["simpson.purpose", "steal_horse"]}, {"eq": ["e.horse_led_out.agent", "simpson"]}]}]}, "asserted": "The purpose values are what these implications say (the slot's own meaning: to drug the guard, to steal the horse); there is nothing to derive them from."},
    {"id": "k.paper_held_opium_means_nobbling", "label": "Had the folded paper held opium, his purpose was to drug the boy.", "by": "police", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.simpson_admits_visit", "c.bribe_to_edith", "c.paper_in_hand"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["paper_packet.contents", "opium"]}, {"eq": ["simpson.purpose", "nobble_horse"]}]}, "asserted": "Gregory's reading of the paper, and the meaning of the purpose value 'nobble_horse'; nothing to derive it from."},
    {"id": "k.bill_is_his_own", "label": "Men do not carry other people's bills: the milliner's account in Straker's pocket was his own.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.milliner_bill", "c.papers_in_pocket", "r.others_bills"], "formula": {"eq": ["milliner_bill.owner", "straker"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.others_bills", "bind": {"doc": "milliner_bill"}}]},
    {"id": "k.bill_names_its_debtor", "label": "The account is made out to William Derbyshire: whoever really owes it is 'Derbyshire'.", "by": "holmes", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.milliner_bill"], "formula": {"same": ["milliner_bill.owner", "william_derbyshire.identity"]}},
    {"id": "k.derbyshire_is_straker", "label": "The bill in Straker's pocket was his own, and it is made out to William Derbyshire: Derbyshire is Straker, under another name.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["k.bill_is_his_own", "k.bill_names_its_debtor"], "formula": {"eq": ["william_derbyshire.identity", "straker"]}},
    {"id": "k.second_household", "label": "A trainer's wages do not buy twenty-guinea dresses, and his wife never had one: 'Derbyshire' was keeping a second establishment, and its cost drove him into debt. If Derbyshire is Straker, that is Straker's motive.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.milliner_bill", "c.bill_22_guineas", "k.dresses_for_the_other_woman", "r.servant_wages", "r.second_establishment", "r.laying_against"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["william_derbyshire.identity", "straker"]}, {"eq": ["straker.motive", "debts_of_second_household"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.servant_wages", "bind": {"buyer": "straker", "buying": "e.dresses_bought", "debt": "e.straker_in_debt"}}, {"rule": "r.second_establishment", "bind": {"buyer": "straker", "wife": "mrs_straker", "buying": "e.dresses_bought", "household": "e.second_household"}}]},
    {"id": "k.second_household_kept", "label": "If Derbyshire is Straker, Straker kept the second establishment, from before the dresses were bought, and fell into debt over it.", "by": "editorial", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.milliner_bill", "c.bill_22_guineas", "k.dresses_for_the_other_woman", "r.servant_wages", "r.second_establishment"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["william_derbyshire.identity", "straker"]}, {"and": [{"eq": ["e.second_household.agent", "straker"]}, {"eq": ["e.straker_in_debt.patient", "straker"]}, {"not_after": ["e.second_household.time", "e.dresses_bought.time"]}]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.servant_wages", "bind": {"buyer": "straker", "buying": "e.dresses_bought", "debt": "e.straker_in_debt"}}, {"rule": "r.second_establishment", "bind": {"buyer": "straker", "wife": "mrs_straker", "buying": "e.dresses_bought", "household": "e.second_household"}}]},
    {"id": "k.dove_silk_on_the_bill", "label": "Holmes read the bill item by item and then asked about one particular costume: the dove-coloured silk is one of the clothes on Derbyshire's account.", "by": "editorial", "premises": ["c.milliner_bill", "c.bill_22_guineas", "c.holmes_plymouth_ruse", "r.asks_about_what_he_read"], "formula": {"same": ["dove_silk_costume.recipient", "e.dresses_bought.recipient"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.asks_about_what_he_read", "bind": {"asked": "dove_silk_costume", "bill": "milliner_bill", "buying": "e.dresses_bought"}}]},
    {"id": "k.dresses_for_the_other_woman", "label": "The dove-coloured silk was among the clothes on the bill, and Mrs. Straker never had it; nor would a maid: the dresses were bought for a woman who is neither the wife nor anyone else in the household.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["k.dove_silk_on_the_bill", "c.wife_never_had_dress", "c.bill_22_guineas", "r.no_finery_for_servants"], "formula": {"nin": ["e.dresses_bought.recipient", ["mrs_straker", "edith_baxter"]]}, "stated": [{"by": "holmes", "source": ["twenty-guinea walking dresses for their ladies"]}], "rules": [{"rule": "r.no_finery_for_servants", "bind": {"buying": "e.dresses_bought", "servant": "edith_baxter"}}]},
    {"id": "k.sheep_lamed_by_hand", "label": "If Straker took the horse out to operate on him, three sheep gone lame on the same farm are no coincidence: someone lamed them, practising.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.sheep_lame", "k.knife_for_an_operation", "r.practise_first"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.horse_led_out.agent", "straker"]}, {"eq": ["e.sheep_go_lame.cause", "someone"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.practise_first", "bind": {"outing": "e.horse_led_out", "practice": "e.practice_on_sheep", "plot": "e.plot_to_lame", "lameness": "e.sheep_go_lame"}}]},
    {"id": "k.practice_first", "label": "So delicate an operation is not attempted without practice; three of the paddock sheep have lately gone lame: Straker practised on them. The lameness is recent ('of late').", "by": "holmes", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.sheep_lame", "r.practise_first", "r.tendon_nick"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.horse_led_out.purpose", "injure"]}, {"and": [{"same": ["e.practice_on_sheep.agent", "e.horse_led_out.agent"]}, {"eq": ["e.sheep_go_lame.cause", "someone"]}, {"eq": ["e.practice_on_sheep.patient", "lame_sheep"]}, {"eq": ["e.practice_on_sheep.place", "paddock"]}, {"in": ["e.practice_on_sheep.time", ["w.weeks_before", "w.mon_day"]]}]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.practise_first", "bind": {"outing": "e.horse_led_out", "practice": "e.practice_on_sheep", "plot": "e.plot_to_lame", "lameness": "e.sheep_go_lame"}}]},
    {"id": "k.lame_plan", "label": "Whoever took the horse out to lame it had plotted to lame it beforehand.", "by": "holmes", "implicit": true, "premises": ["c.stall_empty", "c.sheep_lame", "r.tendon_nick", "r.laying_against", "r.practise_first"], "formula": {"implies": [{"eq": ["e.horse_led_out.purpose", "injure"]}, {"and": [{"same": ["e.plot_to_lame.agent", "e.horse_led_out.agent"]}, {"eq": ["e.plot_to_lame.patient", "silver_blaze"]}, {"same": ["e.lays_against.agent", "e.horse_led_out.agent"]}, {"not_after": ["e.plot_to_lame.time", "e.practice_on_sheep.time"]}, {"before": ["e.lays_against.time", "e.horse_led_out.time"]}]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.laying_against", "bind": {"outing": "e.horse_led_out", "plot": "e.plot_to_lame", "laying": "e.lays_against"}}, {"rule": "r.practise_first", "bind": {"outing": "e.horse_led_out", "practice": "e.practice_on_sheep", "plot": "e.plot_to_lame", "lameness": "e.sheep_go_lame"}}]},
    {"id": "k.at_a_stable_in_reach", "label": "A horse as famous as Silver Blaze is hidden among horses, and only two training stables are in reach: if he is not at King's Pyland, he is at Mapleton.", "by": "editorial", "premises": ["c.geography", "r.hidden_among_horses"], "formula": {"implies": [{"ne": ["silver_blaze.hidden_at", "kings_pyland"]}, {"eq": ["silver_blaze.hidden_at", "mapleton"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.hidden_among_horses", "bind": {"horse": "silver_blaze", "home": "kings_pyland"}}]},
    {"id": "k.horse_at_mapleton_by_reach", "label": "He is not at King's Pyland, and he is hidden among horses within reach: he is at Mapleton, which also has every reason to keep him from running.", "by": "editorial", "premises": ["k.at_a_stable_in_reach", "c.no_news_of_horse"], "formula": {"eq": ["silver_blaze.hidden_at", "mapleton"]}},
    {"id": "k.horse_left_alone", "label": "The horse's track crosses the long hollow alone; a man's track joins it only near Mapleton: he bolted from the hollow by himself, and was met later.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.horse_track_in_wet_hollow", "c.horse_alone"], "formula": {"and": [{"eq": ["e.horse_bolts.agent", "silver_blaze"]}, {"eq": ["e.horse_bolts.place", "wet_hollow"]}, {"before": ["e.horse_bolts.time", "e.brown_finds_horse.time"]}]}},
    {"id": "k.horse_goes_home", "label": "A loose horse makes for its own stable or the nearest other one: from the hollow, Silver Blaze went back to King's Pyland or on to Mapleton.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.horse_was_in_hollow", "r.horse_gregarious"], "formula": {"in": ["silver_blaze.hidden_at", ["kings_pyland", "mapleton"]]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.horse_gregarious", "bind": {"horse": "silver_blaze", "home": "kings_pyland", "nearest": "mapleton", "loose": "e.led_to_hollow"}}]},
    {"id": "k.gypsies_did_not_take_him", "label": "The gypsies cleared out on Tuesday, as travellers do at the first sign of trouble: they did not take the horse to hide him.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.gypsies_gone", "r.gypsies_avoid_trouble"], "formula": {"ne": ["e.horse_hidden.agent", "gypsies"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.gypsies_avoid_trouble", "bind": {"band": "gypsies", "leaving": "e.gypsies_leave", "hiding": "e.horse_hidden"}}]},
    {"id": "k.tracks_end_at_mapleton", "label": "The horse's track, with a man's beside it, ends at the Mapleton gates: the horse is there.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.horse_track_in_wet_hollow", "c.double_track_loops", "r.tracks_lead_in"], "formula": {"and": [{"eq": ["silver_blaze.hidden_at", "mapleton"]}, {"eq": ["e.horse_hidden.place", "mapleton"]}]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.tracks_lead_in", "bind": {"track": "e.brown_turns_back", "hiding": "e.horse_hidden", "horse": "silver_blaze", "stable": "mapleton"}}]},
    {"id": "k.track_man_changed_his_mind", "label": "The man who found the horse set out to lead it home to King's Pyland, then changed his mind and turned back: he found the horse first and made his decision afterwards.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.double_track_loops", "r.leads_where_he_means"], "formula": {"and": [{"eq": ["st.track_man.aims.tue_dawn.before.brown_turns_back", "lead_home"]}, {"ne": ["st.track_man.aims.tue_dawn.after.brown_turns_back", "lead_home"]}]}, "asserted": "Which way a track went is not a facet of the events: that the man meant to take the horse where he first led it is the rule's reading of the track, which the engine cannot derive."},
    {"id": "k.boots_identify", "label": "The square-toed prints match Silas Brown's own boots: he is the man.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["c.square_toes", "r.prints_identify_boots"], "formula": {"same": ["track_man.identity", "brown_boots.owner"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.prints_identify_boots", "bind": {"walker": "track_man", "boots": "brown_boots"}}]},
    {"id": "k.first_up_and_no_subordinate", "label": "The horse went into Mapleton; Brown is its master and always the first stirring, and no groom would dare act without him: it was Brown who took the horse in.", "by": "holmes", "premises": ["k.tracks_end_at_mapleton", "c.brown_first_up", "c.mapleton_brown", "r.first_up_takes_it_in"], "formula": {"eq": ["e.horse_hidden.agent", "silas_brown"]}, "rules": [{"rule": "r.first_up_takes_it_in", "bind": {"stable": "mapleton", "master": "silas_brown", "hiding": "e.horse_hidden"}}]},
